+					 posted, plan_n, len);
+				/* Read-only evidence for the Lead: the 0x01F7
+				 * worker CA 0xB5B9C requires the published
+				 * per-link u32(bandobj+0x1A00) != 0 (else log
+				 * 1442) and the band attach flag
